# The launcher script must be executable inside the image even when the build
# context reaching `docker build` has lost its file modes. Our apps stage the
# docker context in one CI job and build it in another, shipping it through a
# GitHub Actions artifact, and artifact upload/download does not preserve
# permissions. A strategy that inherits the host file mode (e.g. CopyChown)
# therefore produces an image whose entrypoint fails with exit 126.
> Docker/stage
> stripFileModes
> buildStagedContext
> runStagedImage
